Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:28.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs43\pos(1784,747)}Osaka's High School Detective
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:28.04,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1700,827)}Hattori Heiji
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:28.04,Top Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You rebel ronin who dare defy the Shogunate!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.68,0:00:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This Shinsengumi, Okita Soji,\Nwill be your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.95,0:00:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Come at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.54,0:00:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can still go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:00:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut! Cut!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.70,0:01:00.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.16,0:01:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you\Nuntil you understand?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're stabbed, die!\NJust fall down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Private Detective - Mori Kogoro\NThis Mori Kogoro will not fall so easily!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.41,0:01:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.87,0:01:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just a mere extra!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.01,0:01:13.09,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs60\pos(1860,819)}Toyama Kazuha
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.01,0:01:13.09,Sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs43\pos(1784,747)}Heiji's Childhood Friend
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.13,0:01:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi! One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.69,0:01:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,One more time, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.95,0:01:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no! This is my highlight scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.05,0:01:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, it's also written right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yours is the lead role!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ryoma's Holiday."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.23,0:01:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a common dream to write down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.18,0:01:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You samurai boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What is life without a dream?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.32,0:01:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still too early to give up.\NI'll appeal directly to the Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Director! Please give me a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a chance.\NI'll work with all my might.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.51,0:01:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ran-chan, it's been ages!"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"Truth is, when Heiji was in\Nthe middle of a kendo contest..."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.71,0:01:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,"...he was scouted for\Na part in a historical film."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"So we're now in Kyoto shooting it, but..."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.67,0:01:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"Shin'ichi's Childhood Friend - Mori Ran"\N"Why don't you come see the shoot?" Sounds fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.72,0:01:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi, wanna go together?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.42,0:02:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We can zoom over there by plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.17,0:02:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:04.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not interested in movies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.69,0:02:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,So he says. You're interested in\NHattori-kun's activities, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.63,0:02:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Fo... fool! No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Kudo-sempai!\N- Kudo-sempai!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened on your last case?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That was just an elementary trick to solve.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Um!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.94,0:02:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- Your signature! Please give us your autograph!\N- Please shake my hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.91,0:02:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.18,0:02:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyaa! So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.71,0:02:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehh...\NEven if you're not interested in movies...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.05,0:02:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,...you are interested in the junior girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha... what are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.44,0:02:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You turn down an invitation from\Nyour childhood friend...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.49,0:02:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...but you'll be giving those\Njunior girls your autograph?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.50,0:02:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, all right already, all right. I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.13,0:02:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.08,0:02:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine if I go, right?\NSo I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"High School Student Detective - Kudo Shin'ichi"\NMy name is Kudo Shin'ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.32,0:03:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,As a high school student detective,\NI was, well, pretty famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.88,0:03:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But one day when I went out for some fun to\Nan amusement park with my childhood friend Ran...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...I witnessed men in black\Ndoing some suspicious business.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.20,0:03:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And then those guys made me\Ndrink a poison called ABK4869.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.27,0:03:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When I woke up...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.11,0:03:35.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...my body had shrunken!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.37,0:03:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,If it was known by the "Black Organization"\Nthat Kudo Shin'ichi was still alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...harm would come to all those around him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.18,0:03:46.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling myself Edogawa Conan, I solved cases\Nand hunted for information about those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,However, this story was from long before\NI became Edogawa Conan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:58.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Heiwa Fansubs Presents:\N"Conan Special Drama\NKudo Shin'ichi's Kyoto Shinsengumi Murder Case"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.79,0:04:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,"LUNA Airlines/Flight 576"
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.94,0:04:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?\NI just heard a scream.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.71,0:04:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,In there...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.84,0:04:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.50,0:04:39.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, that Shin'ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.25,0:04:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm Sato of the MPD.\N- I'm Takagi of the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.81,0:04:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has touched the body, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.17,0:04:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, just a strange young man earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.72,0:04:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"MPD Investigation Unit One - Takagi Wataru\NMPD Investigation Unit One- Sato Miwako"\NA strange young man?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.05,0:04:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.78,0:04:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.97,0:05:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The cause of death was most likely death by\Nsuffocation due to a cervical spinal cord injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.45,0:05:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The weapon was the sharpened point\Nof a dull-edged tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.14,0:05:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like an ice pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.55,0:05:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When a human is struck here,\Nin the respiratory center of the medulla...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.86,0:05:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...the respiratory neurons pathways\Nbecome impaired...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.58,0:05:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...and so, unable to breathe,\Ndeath comes without a sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.17,0:05:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, before the victim was struck,\Nhe was made to inhale chemicals...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.52,0:05:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...so there's a possibility he had\Nfallen into a coma first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.50,0:05:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,But don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.58,0:05:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The criminal's still here in\Nthis huge clump of iron.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi! Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yes. This was the first page."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.34,0:05:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Kudo Shin'ichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.27,0:05:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.90,0:05:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,"This was the first case of..."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.53,0:05:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"...the high school student detective,\NKudo Shin'ichi."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.10,0:05:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Closed-room Murder at 10,000 meters"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.96,0:05:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The victim is Otaka Kazuhiro, 29.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.83,0:05:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A professional photographer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.88,0:06:02.85,Default,,0,0,0,,About half a year ago, I read an newspaper\Narticle about him winning the Press Photo Award.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.88,0:06:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,"25th Annual Daily Sales Press Photo Award"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.03,0:06:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, his passport was\Ninside his inner vest pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.94,0:06:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It was important to him,\Nso that may be why he put it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.27,0:06:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sorry about this, but this is police work!\N- Oi, come out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.22,0:06:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Children should stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.19,0:06:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, since we'd like to take some photos of the\Ncrime scene, could we borrow a camera from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.03,0:06:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I took a photo of it already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.08,0:06:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.22,0:06:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Based upon the condition of postmortem lividity\Nand given the rigidity of his jaw...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.29,0:06:29.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...I believe that roughly 1 to 2 hours\Nhave passed since he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.83,0:06:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- We don't know if that's a fact yet though.\N- There are 3 things bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The 1st point is that while there are bloodstains flown\Nup against the wall where the corpse was resting...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...there aren't any\Nclinging to his clothes at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.64,0:06:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The 2nd point is that there is another wound\Nto the lower left of the mortal wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.25,0:06:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A mark as if he had been scratched\Nwith the edge of something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.29,0:06:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The 3rd point is that the insides of his\Npants pockets are soaked for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.78,0:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if he had poked his wet hands into them,\Nthey wouldn't have gotten that wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.36,0:07:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Put an end to this!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.56,0:07:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.87,0:07:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you this is police work!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, in order to check for witnesses\Nof any suspicious people...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.64,0:07:11.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...could you please gather the passengers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.24,0:07:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.65,0:07:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,There are just 4 suspects.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.23,0:07:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wai... wait! Why are you saying such bossy\Nthings for! You're just a high school student!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.07,0:07:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you say there are only 4 of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.78,0:07:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,My seat was in coach at the far back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.04,0:07:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,People going to the rear restrooms would have had to\Npass by me and there were no passengers behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.67,0:07:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Of those who did go to the restroom\Naround the estimated time of death...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.55,0:07:39.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...aside from the victim,\Nthere were just 4 people.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.33,0:07:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,By checking their faces,\NI'd know who they were instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.61,0:07:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you were up all night?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.41,0:07:47.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.24,0:07:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't get to sleep that easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.49,0:07:53.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool! Seeing that sleeping face of yours...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.26,0:07:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...there was no way\NI could just calmly go to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.75,0:07:58.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.93,0:08:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, since you're willing to go that far...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.62,0:08:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see if you know who those 4 people are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.09,0:08:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... The 4 people are...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.63,0:08:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:17.97,Default,,0,0,0,,This woman here, the woman next to her...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.06,0:08:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...the man across from them in the aisle seat...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.14,0:08:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...and this foreigner in the seat ahead of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Otaka-san's seat was...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.98,0:08:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.42,0:08:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They were all sitting in proximity\Nto the victim, weren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.52,0:08:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,"Victim"?\NWhat do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.43,0:08:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.65,0:08:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, the four of you please\Ncome to rear restrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.13,0:08:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll discuss the circumstances there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.45,0:08:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Otaka-kun! Otaka-kun!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.91,0:08:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.48,0:08:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lie...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.88,0:09:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... Along with these two women,\Nwe're photographers, the same as Otaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, do I have the right to hear what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, since you are concerned with the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you were sitting near the victim Otaka-san,\Nbut what is your connection to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.94,0:09:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,"Office Worker - Ukai Tsuneo (47)"\NI had no relation to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.61,0:09:18.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm just an ordinary salaryman\Noff on a business trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.16,0:09:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"Photographer - Tachikawa Chizuru (29)\NPhotographer - Saginuma Noboru (30)"\NI and Saginuma-kun were traveling\Nalong with Otaka-kun as friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.05,0:09:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsugumi here...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.49,0:09:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"Photographer - Amano Tsugumi (27)"\N...was Otaka-kun's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,"Freelance Journalist - Edward Crowe (42)"\NAnd the one other person is a foreigner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.90,0:09:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, Tagaki-kun, how's your English?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.39,0:09:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I know a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.63,0:09:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.54,0:09:40.17,Default,,0,0,0,,(What was your relationship to the victim?)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.35,0:09:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,(It was my first time to see him.\NI just came to Japan to buy artwork.)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.66,0:09:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,(Thanks!)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.51,0:09:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he wasn't an acquaintance of Otaka-san's\Nand only came to Japan to buy artwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.10,0:09:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.55,0:09:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,"Once we get them over there..."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.09,0:10:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Photographer - Otaka Kazuhiro (29)"\N"...these negatives'll sell for a high price..."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"...and we can go on wherever\Nyou like for a vacation!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.40,0:10:08.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"You should be happy having\Nsuch a nice boyfriend, oi!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.36,0:10:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"Wait Otaka-kun, be quiet."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"Eh?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,"Could you be quiet?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.20,0:10:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"Everyone is trying to sleep."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.33,0:10:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ah, my bad."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'll be careful next time!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.61,0:10:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"Otaka-kun!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"Behave yourself!"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.72,0:10:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yes, yes. I will."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"Geez, such a scary woman."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.76,0:10:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"Right, Saginuma?"
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.60,0:10:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,"What a boring guy, the rascal."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.94,0:10:38.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"Guess I'll take a nap, too."
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he was killed because\Nof those negatives...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.56,0:10:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But no negatives were found\Non Otaka-san's corpse.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? He should have been keeping them\Nin his inner vest pocket...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.57,0:10:56.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. I'm sure the criminal\Ntook it away with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.75,0:11:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, would each of you 4 tell me the circumstances\Nof what happened when you went to the restroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.70,0:11:06.56,Default,,0,0,0,,When I returned from the restroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.73,0:11:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...Otaka-kun was in his seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.21,0:11:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I remembered feeling a little ill,\Nso I called for a stewardess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.34,0:11:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,"Can I help you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.83,0:11:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry. Can you bring me some\Nmedicine to stop motion sickness?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.08,0:11:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yes. Please wait just a moment."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.55,0:11:24.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I also saw the male victim from\Nthe opposite aisle over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.09,0:11:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were you in the opposite aisle?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.59,0:11:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I was restless, so was just wandering around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.29,0:11:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"Though I had been sleeping soundly,\Nbecause of a noisy passenger, I was woken up."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.90,0:11:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"It was that man."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.86,0:11:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was when Tsugumi-san\Nwas asking for medicine...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.43,0:11:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,...that I saw the male victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.24,0:11:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I went to the restroom right after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.61,0:11:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I was woken up when\Nthe stewardess brought the medicine...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.43,0:11:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But at that time Otaka-kun\Nwasn't there any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,"Did you take the motion sickness\Nmedicine I gave you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yeah..."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.18,0:11:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"That's strange..."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.59,0:12:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Saginuma-kun had taken some, too..."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"...but it seems to have been\Neffective on him, doesn't it?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.55,0:12:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,"In that case, why don't we switch seats? If you're\Nnext to a window, maybe that'll change your mood."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Okay?"\N- "Yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.97,0:12:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"Excuse me.\NThe medicine is for her."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ah, here you go."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.56,0:12:26.08,Default,,0,0,0,,- "Here."\N- "Thank you..."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.24,0:12:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ala. Where's Otaka-kun?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.35,0:12:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ah... Seems he went somewhere."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.60,0:12:38.47,Default,,0,0,0,,"To the restroom? Otaka-kun, too?"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.51,0:12:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I then went to the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.24,0:12:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it can be said Otaka-san stood up\Nfrom his seat to go to the restroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.82,0:12:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...after Tsugumi-san had asked for the medicine\Nbut before it was brought to her, couldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.89,0:12:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then after that, Chizuru-san you said\Nyou went to the restroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.92,0:12:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, when I went to the restroom,\NOtaka-san was still alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.55,0:13:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,"Restroom In Use"\NWhen I asked if he was okay and knocked,\Nhe knocked back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.87,0:13:08.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You knew exactly which restroom\Nhe entered, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.83,0:13:09.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.96,0:13:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the locks to all\Nthe other restrooms were open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.53,0:13:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, the one remaining person is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.52,0:13:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,(When were you in the bathroom?)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.65,0:13:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,(I don't remember what time it was.)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.04,0:13:27.89,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he doesn't remember\Nwhat time it was he went in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.34,0:13:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.23,0:13:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.40,0:13:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...his cologne is so intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.42,0:13:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,And now we've heard the stories of\Neveryone who went to the restroom, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.03,0:13:41.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a moment please.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.37,0:13:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There was one other person\Nwho rose from their seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.75,0:13:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,This person.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.97,0:13:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.63,0:13:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I was asleep the entire time!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.32,0:13:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Your seat was directly behind\Nthe murdered Otaka-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.16,0:14:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When Otaka-san was sleeping,\Nthere was no one in that seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.23,0:14:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you must have\Ngotten up from your seat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop spouting nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.96,0:14:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I wasn't mentioned as one of the 4 people\Nwho got up to go to the restroom! Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Ah, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.69,0:14:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Be certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.89,0:14:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.05,0:14:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling I was distracted momentarily...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.19,0:14:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it was you who...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.86,0:14:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, shouldn't you be hurrying to find\Neither the negatives or the murder weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.12,0:14:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's certainly true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, all of you come for a physical exam\Nand a check of your luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.80,0:14:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And you, too, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.03,0:14:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Me, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Would that inconvenience you somehow?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.91,0:15:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see. Next is Tsugumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.76,0:15:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,In here we have a passport, a wallet...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...and a sewing kit with some scissors, but it'd\Nbe impossible to kill someone with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.22,0:15:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Have you checked the contents of the pen?\N- Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.83,0:15:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be possible to hide the deadly weapon\Nas part of its core section.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.57,0:15:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Core?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.72,0:15:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Core... core!\NI'll check the core now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.53,0:15:12.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah look, the core is in good order.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.04,0:15:15.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see, next is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.29,0:15:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...oh, Edward-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a checkbook from\Nthe American National Bank...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.10,0:15:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ask him, ask him...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.34,0:15:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,(What were you going\Nto use this checkbook for?)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.73,0:15:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,(I brought it to buy pieces\Nat a Japanese auction.)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.69,0:15:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,(Ah, collecting artwork is a hobby of mine.)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.25,0:15:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,(Unfortunately, it was all junk\Nand a waste of time.)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.93,0:15:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,He says it was in order to purchase artwork\Nbut that he didn't get to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,(I can tell you have a great sense of art...)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.58,0:15:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,(...from that beautiful watch.\NCan I take a look?)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.40,0:15:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,(Sure.)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.51,0:16:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,"Though the smell of his cologne\Nwas quite strong around his neck..."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"...I couldn't smell anything from his wrist."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,"Didn't he put any on his wrist..."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.60,0:16:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,(Thanks.)
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.18,0:16:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, next is...\NSaginuma-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.57,0:16:16.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you are; go to town.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, um, this, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.92,0:16:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see... You seem to have a lot\Nof medicine to prevent motion sickness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.03,0:16:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm weak when it comes to vehicles.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.91,0:16:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsugumi and Chizuro take them too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.35,0:16:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.06,0:16:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,These are... negatives, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.10,0:16:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What about them?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.86,0:16:39.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a photographer,\Nso of course I'd have negatives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.03,0:16:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The person with the woman in these pictures...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.59,0:16:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the American Senator,\NDickson-san, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.96,0:16:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.95,0:16:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't those the same negatives\Nas Otaka-kun's?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.70,0:16:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,By "the same," do you mean the ones that\Nwere missing from the victim's corpse?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.18,0:16:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- So if you have those...\N- Saginuma-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.73,0:17:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...did you kill Otaka-san\Nand then steal those negatives?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.63,0:17:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,These are mine!\NI took these together with Otaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Otaka's photos were far worse than mine,\Nso I intended to sell mine to a newspaper, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys heard Otaka talking about that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.80,0:17:18.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.08,0:17:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, if you are suspicious of me,\Nthen bring out the murder weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.97,0:17:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The criminal should still have\Nthe murder weapon, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But the murder weapon\Nhasn't been found anywhere yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.01,0:17:29.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It still remains for us\Nto find the murder weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.20,0:17:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But it didn't appear\Nduring the physical checks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.98,0:17:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.04,0:17:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The most important place\Nhas been overlooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.39,0:17:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The most important place?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The murdered Otaka-san's luggage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.08,0:17:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all that's left...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.07,0:17:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.39,0:17:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, which is Otaka-san's luggage?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.89,0:17:53.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.72,0:17:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.43,0:17:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I just remember he had left his bag\Nbehind at his studio one week ago...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.15,0:18:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,...but it had been cut up by a knife...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.80,0:18:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So I bought him a new bag for this trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.98,0:18:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's possible he had hidden\Nthe negatives in his previous bag...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.56,0:18:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...and those cuts may have come from\Nsomeone searching for them, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.97,0:18:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There doesn't appear to be anything here that\Ncould be used as the murder weapon...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.41,0:18:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, this is just the deduction of a\Nhigh-school student affecting to be a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.06,0:18:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,"What is it about this case..."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.50,0:18:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,"If the murder weapon can't be found..."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.06,0:18:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"...I also won't be able to figure out\Nwho killed Otaka-san..."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.56,0:18:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"Is someone giving false testimony...?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.87,0:18:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I thought, you're the criminal, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.97,0:18:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.65,0:18:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time this lady was asking\Nthe stewardess for the medicine...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.30,0:19:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...you weren't in the seat\Nbehind the sleeping Otaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.29,0:19:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a minute! When the stewardess\Nbrought the medicine I was woken up...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.57,0:19:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...but Saginuma-kun was sleeping in the seat\Nbehind, right? Otaka-kun was gone, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.03,0:19:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,There, see!\NI said you were spouting nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.07,0:19:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But, even this stewardess saw that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.93,0:19:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. I don't think he was there...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.21,0:19:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, what are you guys suggesting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:23.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hear from the crewmember\Nwho brought the medicine as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.29,0:19:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time Tsugumi-san asked for the medicine,\Nwas this person in the seat behind Otaka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.31,0:19:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I was fast asleep, right? Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.52,0:19:34.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh... whether he was there\Nor whether he wasn't there...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.18,0:19:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Otaka-san was there, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.39,0:19:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That I do remember. He had put on an eye mask\Nand a blanket and was asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.76,0:19:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there anyone in front of Otaka-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.47,0:19:48.24,Default,,0,0,0,,As I recall, there wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.46,0:19:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.99,0:19:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Saginuma's seat was, if I remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.81,0:20:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.44,0:20:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,"I knew it!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.84,0:20:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,"There's no mistake."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.89,0:20:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,"The criminal is that person!"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.47,0:20:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you turn up nothing so suddenly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.29,0:20:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"Nothing"? I know who the criminal is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.93,0:20:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? No way!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,All that's left is the trick\Nbehind the murder weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.03,0:20:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.09,0:20:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! No, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.85,0:20:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.73,0:20:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Where were you touching me!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't on purpose!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.46,0:20:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, they are bigger\Nthan I thought they were.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.42,0:20:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran is a high school student.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.61,0:20:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi, you PERVERT!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.49,0:21:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that... Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.73,0:21:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to ask you this because you've\Nbecome a high school student...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.51,0:21:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.35,0:21:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... What is it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.13,0:21:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, hurry and tell me.\NI'm embarrassed for even asking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That last person; thing is they're almost so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.35,0:21:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. So that's it...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.29,0:21:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?! What is it you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.34,0:21:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I've figured it out at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.20,0:21:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The criminal's trump card for how\Nthey ended the victim's life...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.06,0:21:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The trick of the murder weapon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.48,0:21:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Chizuru-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.06,0:21:52.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it true that there was a\Nreturning knock from the restroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.68,0:21:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What need would there be for me\Nto lie about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.80,0:21:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Because it seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.23,0:21:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,...you went to the restroom\Nand afterwards, Otaka-san was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.55,0:22:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- In other words...\N- She didn't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.58,0:22:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When Chizuru-san knocked...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:08.35,Default,,0,0,0,,...there was someone else in the restroom\Nwith the victim's corpse other than the criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.38,0:22:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.55,0:22:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Please remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.38,0:22:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's bloodstains scattered on the wall of the\Nrestroom that got there during the time of the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.83,0:22:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet, on the back of the body which was\Nleaning against the wall, there was no blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.86,0:22:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That was because the blood from the time of\NOtaka-san's murder had dried on the wall...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.64,0:22:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...and that someone other than\Nthe criminal then moved his body afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was the body moved?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because they were\Nlooking for the negatives...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.98,0:22:41.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...that Otaka-san should have had on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.40,0:22:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.31,0:22:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...Edward-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.79,0:22:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were looking for the negatives,\Nyou also checked his pants pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.69,0:23:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That was when the cologne on your wrist\Ngot stuck to his pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.66,0:23:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So in a rush, you washed your hands\Nand wet a handkerchief.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.38,0:23:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You then used that to wipe away\Nthe unique smell from the pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.91,0:23:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The only evidence of that is your wrist...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.85,0:23:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have cologne on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.30,0:23:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Edward-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.05,0:23:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...truth is, you speak Japanese, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and speak it for your own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.94,0:23:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's as this boy says.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.63,0:23:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- Eh?! He spoke Japanese!\N- He spoke it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.66,0:23:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The scandal photos taken of Senator Dickson.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.50,0:23:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I was asked to purchase the negatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.70,0:23:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,When I heard he'd gone to the restroom, I thought\Nthat would be a chance to do a trade with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.80,0:23:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But he was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.77,0:23:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He was bent over at the waist.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.32,0:24:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,"Restroom In Use"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.51,0:24:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I thought it was wrong of me...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.52,0:24:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...I searched his body for the negatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.26,0:24:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, when I knocked, the one who answered...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.05,0:24:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,"Otaka-kun, are you okay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.11,0:24:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I was surprised at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.58,0:24:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter how much I looked for them,\NI couldn't find those negatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.97,0:24:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Edward-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.12,0:24:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,...and Chizuru-san, who knocked from outside,\Ncan't be considered as the criminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.44,0:24:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That leaves 2 remaining suspects,\NUkai-san and Tsugumi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.17,0:24:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.89,0:24:37.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What bothered me was Ukai-san's testimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.03,0:24:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time Tsugumi-san\Nwas asking for the medicine...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.47,0:24:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,...he says Saginuma-san wasn't in his seat\Nbehind the victim, Otaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.29,0:24:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... I wasn't lying!\NEven the stewardess saw that!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.96,0:24:50.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And I said I WAS asleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.71,0:24:53.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of you two are lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.22,0:24:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the differing testimony\Nbetween you two...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.88,0:25:00.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...that provided an important clue\Nto finding the criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.93,0:25:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you know who the criminal is?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.60,0:25:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.49,0:25:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The criminal who murdered Otaka-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.67,0:25:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...was...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.82,0:25:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The criminal who murdered Otaka-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.03,0:25:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,...was...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.27,0:25:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsugumi-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.34,0:25:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,...it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.31,0:25:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.70,0:25:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be joking!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.77,0:25:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Evidence! Where's your evidence?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.27,0:25:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There is proper evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.32,0:25:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Because Tsugumi-san should still\Nhave the murder weapon on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.21,0:25:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsugumi took the physical search too, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.44,0:25:44.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if she was checked...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.49,0:25:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,...the weapon used to murder\NOtaka-san wouldn't be considered suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.13,0:25:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It would also pass through the metal detector at a\Nboarding gate and is a thing characteristic of women.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.93,0:25:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Characteristic of women?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.50,0:25:55.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, there couldn't be such\Na convenient thing, could there?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.02,0:25:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There is.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.60,0:26:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Tsugumi-san's...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.03,0:26:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.51,0:26:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The wire from the underwear of\NTsugumi-san's right breast.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.78,0:26:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- Underwear wire?!\N- No, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.67,0:26:16.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd be impossible to kill someone\Nwith something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.22,0:26:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The wire had been sharpened ahead of time\Nand then stabbed into the back of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.66,0:26:24.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Multiplied using the weight from her entire body,\Nit would reach the cervical spinal cord.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.13,0:26:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a crime that even a woman could commit.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.09,0:26:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,If the wire that had been used as the murder\Nweapon was thrown away and discovered...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.81,0:26:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,...the woman who didn't have a wire in her underwear\Nwould have been exposed as the criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.44,0:26:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If it's that... If Tsugumi takes a body search,\Nthat'd be fine, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.07,0:26:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's no use, Saginuma-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.46,0:26:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,If they searched me again\Nthey'd find out right away...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.19,0:26:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.40,0:26:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsugumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.63,0:26:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To start off, Tsugumi-san was in the seat\Nnext to the sleeping Chizuru-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.00,0:27:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...when Otaka-san went to the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.08,0:27:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, just as he opened the door...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.14,0:27:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,...he was hit with a handkerchief soaked\Nin chemicals and soon lost consciousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.57,0:27:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Removing the wire from her underwear,\Nshe pierced Otaka-san's cervical spinal cord...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.76,0:27:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,...asphyxiating him to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.98,0:27:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were sticking him with the wire...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.60,0:27:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...that scratch wound on his body was caused by\Nthe wire end that hadn't been sharpened, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.35,0:27:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,To feign that the crime involved the negatives...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.24,0:27:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...you used the scissors from your\Nsewing kit to cut up the negatives...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.38,0:27:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,...and then flushed them down the toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.02,0:27:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,And, when Tsugumi-san had returned from\Nthe restroom to her seat...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.21,0:27:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...using a knit hat and eye mask...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.89,0:27:47.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...she disguised Saginuma-san as Otaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.05,0:27:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ma’am, can I help you?"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.43,0:27:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"I'm sorry. Can you bring me some\Nmedicine to stop motion sickness?"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.54,0:27:56.69,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yes. Please wait just a moment."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.66,0:28:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why Ukai-san could mistake\Nthe disguised Saginuma-san for being Otaka-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.07,0:28:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,By doing that, Tsugumi-san created an illusion for\Nthe time when Otaka-san had gone to the restroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.54,0:28:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"Are you okay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.68,0:28:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a darkened cabin...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.56,0:28:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...and all that was sticking out from\Nthe blanket was his nose and up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.73,0:28:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's reasonable to have made such a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.07,0:28:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ah, the medicine is for her."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.57,0:28:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The evidence that Tsugumi-san used the trick of\Ndisguising Saginuma-san was a piece of negative...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.30,0:28:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...that had fallen into the seat next to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.73,0:28:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If a piece had gotten stuck to her clothes\Nwhile she was cutting up the negatives...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.90,0:28:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,...it would fall off when she was\Nsetting up the disguise, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.40,0:28:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, that empty seat that I said I saw...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.46,0:28:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The seat behind Saginuma-san was free,\Nso you misunderstood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.80,0:28:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What if the seat next to me\Nhadn't been vacant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.18,0:28:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case making such a disguise\Nwould have been impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.93,0:28:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsugumi-san, you had the seat next to him\Nreserved and didn't cancel it, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.41,0:29:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,By doing so, she would be certain to ensure\Na vacant seat next to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.90,0:29:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How could anyone possibly sleep through having\Na hat and eye mask put on them and not wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.57,0:29:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If the drug to prevent motion sickness given to\NSaginuma-san by Tsugumi-san was a sleeping pill...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.11,0:29:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,...he wouldn't have awakened easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.97,0:29:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,A knit hat like Otaka-san's was\Nalso in Tsugumi-san's luggage...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.69,0:29:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...so when his shape when sleeping\Nwas recalled, there wouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.68,0:29:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.30,0:29:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Tsugumi...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.15,0:29:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.69,0:29:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He took the Grand Prize photo\Nbecause of a fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.72,0:29:40.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But it was that photo that triggered\Nyou and him seeing one another...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.38,0:29:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.99,0:29:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that photo,\NI became interested in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.91,0:29:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,"25th Annual Daily Sales Press Photo Award"\NThe first time I saw his photo, my heart quivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.40,0:29:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Preciousness of Life" Award\NGoes to Otaka Kazuhiro"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.71,0:29:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The fear and tragedy of a fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.07,0:29:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,...as well as the preciousness of life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.44,0:30:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a person who could\Nexpress all that in a photo.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.50,0:30:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, why then!?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.78,0:30:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of that photo,\Nmy older brother's life was taken away!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.96,0:30:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that\NOtaka-san himself set that fire...?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.88,0:30:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.18,0:30:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,It had come from his apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.31,0:30:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The amount of smoke rising up to my brother's\Napartment increased by the moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.72,0:30:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't believe it at first.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.17,0:30:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But, when I asked him about it...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.85,0:30:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,...he bragged about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.82,0:30:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,"It was a good moment that\NI had been waiting for."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.28,0:30:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,"I made it myself!"
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.86,0:30:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"Onii-chan! Onii-chan!"
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.18,0:31:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There just wasn't any way\NI could forgive him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.04,0:31:10.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.05,0:31:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But this is vexing...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I was confident...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.96,0:31:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...that I had hidden the weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.96,0:31:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,When you reached up for Otaka-san's luggage...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.24,0:31:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...for some reason you displayed\Nan unnatural movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.55,0:31:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,When I remembered that, I was convinced.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.02,0:31:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The sharpened point of the wire was touching\Nyour skin, causing you to hesitate unconsciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.03,0:32:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But if that was all...?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.14,0:32:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a big thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.66,0:32:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But what should have been just a casual act was\Nbranded in my memory as an unnatural movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.04,0:32:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the small points that can be overlooked...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.68,0:32:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...that are the most important points of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.19,0:32:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.11,0:32:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Acting all great...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.00,0:32:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, touching a person's chest\Nto find a clue like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.89,0:32:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's totally sexual harassment!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.64,0:32:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,That's totally sexual harassment!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.69,0:32:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi! What are you saying out of the blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.30,0:32:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.70,0:32:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I... was sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.84,0:32:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,"Everyone, we will be landing soon\Nat Osaka's Itami Airport..."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.54,0:32:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!\NYou're wrong, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.12,0:32:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.89,0:33:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kyoto\NThe Film Studio Mystery Case"
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.60,0:33:04.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez. I ended up embarrassed\Nbecause of you talking in your sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.02,0:33:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kyoto"\NHow persistent! I couldn't help it, could I?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.29,0:33:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we took that flight a year ago\Nand this one had the same feel to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.62,0:33:14.31,Default,,0,0,0,,...so I unintentionally had a dream about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.07,0:33:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this really the right road?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.32,0:33:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If we keep going just as we are, we'll just arrive at\Nthe Yamano temple, famous for its sakura trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.33,0:33:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.02,0:33:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"Yamano Temple"\NAla... That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.86,0:33:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,"Good Luck Bookmark"\NPerhaps it's around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.03,0:33:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,"Matchmaker"\NAh! Aren't these...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.06,0:33:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,...the Lucky Bookmarks that have been\Nso fashionable lately?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.71,0:33:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky Bookmarks?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.97,0:33:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know all the details...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.18,0:33:47.75,Default,,0,0,0,,...but they seem to be pretty popular\Non TV and in magazines.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.87,0:33:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know all the details though.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.28,0:33:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehh... Is that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.85,0:33:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Say. Since we happened across them by chance,\Ncouldn't we take a little look?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.12,0:33:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, we don't have time... Oi!\N- Right! Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.40,0:34:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"Good Luck Bookmark"\NWelcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.35,0:34:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Our store's lucky bookmarks brings to both\Nsingle people and couples and of course you...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.42,0:34:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,...the nice atmosphere of being a couple and\Nare an extremely popular matchmaking product.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.98,0:34:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Matchmaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.01,0:34:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.79,0:34:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?\NI didn't know anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.58,0:34:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this sakura-colored bookmark?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.31,0:34:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,They're available for a limited 2 week period\Nand will only be sold until tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.02,0:34:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like with a normal bookmark,\Nit's also possible to affix your names on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.58,0:34:32.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.90,0:34:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.04,0:34:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fool. There's no way I could buy\Nmatchmaking goods.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.61,0:34:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, here, here!\NI've been looking for these!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.78,0:34:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Mama, since I want to bring a souvenir\Nfor everyone in my class, please buy me these.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.29,0:34:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, can't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.57,0:34:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, weren't you guys gonna buy some?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.81,0:34:56.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's okay.\NWe'll buy some after you. Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.07,0:34:59.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Yeah..
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.43,0:35:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Then that's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.65,0:35:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,"Merchandise Sold Out"\NIt's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.01,0:35:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl bought up all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.82,0:35:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Some fresh goods will\Ncome again in this evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.73,0:35:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,"Welcome - Kyoto Futomaki Film Studio"\N(Futomaki = Large Roll Sushi)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.71,0:35:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more incredible than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.06,0:35:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They've even reproduced\Nthe old streets of Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.70,0:35:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.33,0:35:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this? You're still angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.71,0:35:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.14,0:35:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not angry!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.42,0:35:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it this way?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.93,0:35:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez! Shin'ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.49,0:35:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sakuraba, You'll Be Killed"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.70,0:35:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,"Role of Sakamoto Ryoma, Sakuraba Reiichi"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.32,0:35:49.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was it that sent me such a thing!?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.19,0:35:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"Role of Maidservant, Sugita Fumiko"\NIt's just a common harassment letter.\NI'm sure it's from a Momoka-chan fan.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.91,0:35:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It was put in the dressing room.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.04,0:35:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's natural to think it was the act\Nof someone authorized to work here!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.76,0:36:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.58,0:36:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They just envy my popularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.37,0:36:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, stop this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.92,0:36:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,We're over already!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.27,0:36:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.65,0:36:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.19,0:36:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wai... say.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.16,0:36:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoma has his Oryo, doesn't he?\N(Oryo was Sakamoto Ryoma's wife)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.98,0:36:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Momoka that I'm concerned about!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.60,0:36:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.52,0:36:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,...just went out with that woman\Nfor publicity sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.30,0:36:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.33,0:36:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,...it has to be you...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.35,0:36:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.32,0:37:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,"Role of Oryo, Hayashibara Momoka"\NI thought you were behaving strangely recently...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.34,0:37:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,...but I guess you're having an affair\Nwith your ex-girlfriend?!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.25,0:37:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know who\Nyou have to thank for this role?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.65,0:37:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you intended to do this movie just for this,\Nthen I'm going to ruin it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.79,0:37:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Resolve yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.27,0:37:20.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Say. Chase after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.86,0:37:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.25,0:37:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,She might be serious about ruining this film.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.32,0:37:28.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.71,0:37:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if it's just a small role,\NI want to finish it properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.79,0:37:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.\NIt'll be okay if I follow her, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.21,0:38:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the confusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.22,0:38:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't mean to peep at you or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.59,0:38:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they shooting the historical movie,\N"Ryoma's Holiday" at? We've gotten lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.96,0:38:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Ah... That would be this way.\N- Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.14,0:38:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, you dropped this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.22,0:38:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.03,0:38:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.93,0:38:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.98,0:38:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Say! Wasn't she with the Idol\NHayashibara Momoka...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.33,0:38:32.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the actor Sakuraba Reiichi just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.43,0:38:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sakuraba Reiichi"?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.02,0:38:38.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, that's what they were discussing back then.\NThose two have been seeing each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.26,0:38:41.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It had been in "Friday."
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.19,0:38:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've discovered how devoted they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.38,0:38:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a show biz otaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.88,0:38:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,"Role of Nakaoka Shintaro, Iwasaki Ryuji"\N(close associate of Sakamoto Ryoma)
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.37,0:38:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ala, what's the matter, Momoka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.92,0:39:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be you quarreled with Sakuraba?\NHe's been in good riding condition recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.13,0:39:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Disgusting!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.17,0:39:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't speak to me so crudely!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.11,0:39:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.02,0:39:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehh...!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.72,0:39:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a set before.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.07,0:39:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's pretty dusty, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.45,0:39:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.80,0:39:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.15,0:39:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no... Sorry, sorry, sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.12,0:39:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,"Ran's Father, Private Detective - Mori Kogoro"\NI just raised the sword and it slipped outta my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.96,0:39:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.03,0:39:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,And after we went to a lot of trouble\Nto come see you, Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.60,0:39:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dad! If you're not really careful,\Nthere'll be a horrible accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.40,0:39:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you need to hold a sword properly or...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.47,0:39:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Doyle!?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.90,0:39:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran-chan, you came!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.72,0:39:54.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Kazuha-chan! It's been forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.53,0:39:57.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh, huh? What's this?\NYou guys know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.55,0:40:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We solved a case together once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.25,0:40:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I showed Doyle here my\Nbrilliant deductions. Right, Doyle?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.06,0:40:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- This guy's name is Kudo...\N- Do, do...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.10,0:40:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- I go by the nickname Doyle.\N- I'm turning down this role!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.31,0:40:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.48,0:40:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that Momoka-chan\Nwon't perform the role of Oryo!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.45,0:40:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Because!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.63,0:40:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The acting in the Ryoma role\Ndoesn't match up with mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.32,0:40:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why either I go\Nor you change who's playing Ryoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.62,0:40:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,For the role of Sakamoto Ryoma,\Nyou must give it to me, Mori Kogoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.49,0:40:32.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.69,0:40:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Read the atmosphere around you!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.24,0:40:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!\NFumiko-san could you be my understudy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.15,0:40:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to be a great favorite\Nof Ryoma's as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.71,0:40:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.58,0:40:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think you're some princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.15,0:40:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the leading role!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.60,0:40:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That leading role was thanks to me, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.77,0:40:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes. This movie, too, is thanks to Momoka-chan's\Npopularity, so this also concerns the sponsors. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.74,0:40:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Supporting roles will be silent!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.88,0:41:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, I'm declining the role!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.84,0:41:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.14,0:41:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,At this rate, the schedule'll go all to hell...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.28,0:41:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, this is a disturbing\Natmosphere, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.07,0:41:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The cause of it is that Idol's selfishness.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.77,0:41:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this a lover's quarrel between\NSakuraba-san and her?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.56,0:41:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess those two are seeing each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.01,0:41:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Talk about Sakuraba-san and Momoka-chan\Nhas raised their popularity.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.45,0:41:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems the leading role went to him\Nbecause of Momoka-chan's support.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.60,0:41:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I read in a weekly magazine\Nthat that handsome actor...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.33,0:41:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,...has even insured his own face.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.30,0:41:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmpf! What a narcissist.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.39,0:41:42.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- I heard about that, too.\N- Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.81,0:41:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.27,0:41:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,An actor's face is their life.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.34,0:42:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,"Hayashibara Momoka-sama"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.11,0:42:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.52,0:42:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That idiot Sakuraba, angering Momoka like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.96,0:42:22.93,Default,,0,0,0,,If a popular Idol turns down her role,\NI'm the one who loses their job!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.97,0:42:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.80,0:42:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"Assistant Director:\NTanaka Taiki"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.27,0:42:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"Movie Director:\NKashimoto Yoshihiro"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.41,0:42:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,," Popular Idol Hayashibara Momoka\Nand Hot Actor Inside a Car Making Love!"
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.43,0:42:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, then everyone, thank you for waiting.\NWe will be testing this scene on Stage 44.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.29,0:42:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stand by!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.53,0:43:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- If you would please.\N- If you please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.20,0:43:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, do you really intend to go with that look?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.60,0:43:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You have a problem with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.87,0:43:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your mustache, your mustache!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.44,0:43:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The Shinsengumi wouldn't have had\Nsuch mustaches, would they!?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.10,0:43:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my trademark!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.27,0:43:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I can't shave it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.15,0:43:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Fight earnestly, just like we rehearsed.\N- Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.77,0:43:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Sakuraba-chan, if you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.07,0:43:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.27,0:43:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, then Director, if you would please.\N- If you would please.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.95,0:43:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Then this is the main test!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.14,0:43:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,- Main test!\N- Then this is the main test!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.33,0:43:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.93,0:43:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.73,0:43:43.05,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Shinsengumi! Hurry and flee!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.00,0:43:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of official business!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.36,0:44:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.17,0:44:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Resolve yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.18,0:44:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You say the dawn of a new Japan\Nis right before your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.34,0:44:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Come.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.79,0:44:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Nakaoka Shintaro, will be your opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.15,0:44:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out! Watch out you fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.70,0:44:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch out, I said!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.93,0:44:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Those swords aren't real, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.36,0:44:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, they're fakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.78,0:44:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But those sparks...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.33,0:44:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a device in the sword...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.96,0:44:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...that allows electricity\Nto flow out as sparks from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.75,0:44:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like you, Doyle-kun.\NYou know a lot, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.18,0:44:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just like a detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.74,0:44:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I just knew... coincidentally is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.09,0:45:00.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Nakaoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.67,0:45:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryoma!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.97,0:45:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.04,0:45:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.98,0:45:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can still go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.05,0:45:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.43,0:45:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.99,0:45:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hattori! Sir! Escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.70,0:45:39.11,Default,,0,0,0,,My face!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.18,0:45:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My face!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.20,0:45:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Reiichi! Reiichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.68,0:45:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My face!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.04,0:45:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Reiichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.19,0:45:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sir!\N- Reiichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.79,0:45:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hattori!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.42,0:45:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hattori!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.61,0:45:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,An ambulance!\NSomeone please call for an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.68,0:45:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.16,0:46:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Heiji...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.53,0:46:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,"Charm"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.50,0:46:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hattori's unconscious.\NYour father's also refusing visitors.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.96,0:46:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,How could this...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.49,0:46:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.24,0:46:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You and Reiichi are over, aren't you?\NWhat do you mean by coming to the hospital?!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.07,0:46:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just worried about Sakuraba-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.72,0:46:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You say such things...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.52,0:46:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...but truth is, you want to\Nget back with him, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.22,0:46:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just because your\Nex-boyfriend became popular...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.01,0:46:46.47,Default,,0,0,0,,How undignified.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.63,0:46:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.74,0:46:50.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.15,0:46:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,A supporting player like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.20,0:46:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...just wouldn't be in synch with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.73,0:47:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuraba-san! After such a large burn,\Nyou should rest for at least a little longer...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.31,0:47:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You two stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.20,0:47:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I could hear you from the consultation room.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.79,0:47:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with tone of voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.66,0:47:11.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I expressly followed you here to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.89,0:47:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Will your injury be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.44,0:47:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that big a deal...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.05,0:47:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,But it is painful as an actor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.82,0:47:26.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What will happen to your role?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.94,0:47:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,After getting the lead role after so long...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.07,0:47:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have to talk with the Director...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.12,0:47:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,...and see whether they'll resume with the shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.62,0:47:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.55,0:47:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What shoot!?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.80,0:47:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look you. If I'm not there,\Nno one'll care if I had a partner or not!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.73,0:47:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is, since when are you on such\Ngood terms with unpopular actors?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.12,0:48:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,"Sakuraba, You'll Be Killed"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.56,0:48:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, returning to the village set is fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.19,0:48:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...but the shoot might be canceled, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.31,0:48:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That was such an explosive accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.24,0:48:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not limited to being just an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.74,0:48:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you be Kudo Shin'ichi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.06,0:48:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. That's right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.89,0:48:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Inukai of Kyoto's Prefectural police.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.56,0:48:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,"Kyoto Prefectural Police Detective - Inukai Hajime"\NOh, sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.09,0:48:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.75,0:48:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard rumors about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.25,0:48:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,One year ago, you splendidly settled that case\Non an airliner, didn't you? That was a big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.72,0:48:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.85,0:48:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have you tell me\Nthat story sometime...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.77,0:49:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, but before that,\Nyou should have a look at the set.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.59,0:49:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, oh, I should!\NAh, which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.06,0:49:05.47,Default,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.37,0:49:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you a Detective?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.29,0:49:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.10,0:49:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have something to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.76,0:49:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... Sakuraba-san was sent\Na threatening letter, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.69,0:49:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Does Sakuraba-san have any ideas\Nabout who it might be?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.83,0:49:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,He was an action actor who\Nwasn't popular for a long time...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.05,0:49:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...but on the set of one of them\Nhe became acquainted with Momoka-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.31,0:49:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And then she introduced him to\Nvarious producers...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.24,0:49:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...and he started picking up\Njobs one after another...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.07,0:49:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks to his lover he became a star...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.21,0:49:47.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...so there'd be lots of guys jealous of him,\Nwouldn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.74,0:49:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Please stop talking that way.\NHe's been working hard all this time at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.39,0:49:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to have such an injury to his face...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.68,0:50:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to be rude, but what sort of relationship\Ndo you have with Sakuraba-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.99,0:50:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just from the same theatrical company.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.09,0:50:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I became anxious about\Nthat threatening letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.45,0:50:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.76,0:50:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please see to it that Sakuraba-kun\Ndoesn't come into any further danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.07,0:50:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be called an attempted murder?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.65,0:50:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's neither traces of\Na gas leak nor explosive material.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.50,0:50:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What was it that caused the explosion?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.50,0:50:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,At the time of the explosion, fine particles\Nof dust were dancing around in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.97,0:50:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Dust?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.20,0:50:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dust wouldn't have anything to do with\Nan explosion, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.98,0:50:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A dust explosion.\N(Funjin bakuhatsu)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.94,0:50:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Explosive wind?\N(Fujin bakuhatsu)
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.84,0:50:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,A DUST explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.55,0:50:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It uses the characters for "powder" and "dirt,"\Nso dust. Well in essence, fine powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.22,0:50:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.64,0:50:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Can such an explosion come from powder?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.17,0:50:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,If you apply fire directly to some powder,\Nit wouldn't burn much...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.36,0:51:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,...but once it comes in contact with\Noxygen and floats in the air...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.84,0:51:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...it's then in a state that is quite flammable.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.22,0:51:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,And, if even one of those particles\Ncomes in contact with fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.29,0:51:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,...it spreads quickly around to all the surrounding\Npowder and explodes with considerable power.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.11,0:51:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Throwing up a cloud of dust powder\Nmakes it easily combustible...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.67,0:51:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,...and, more particularly,\Neasy to cause an explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.01,0:51:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely the criminal...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.44,0:51:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Knowing that imitation ash\Nwould be dancing around...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.88,0:51:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...that trick swords would be sparking and that\Nthe fight would be performed around this heath...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.05,0:51:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,...and that ash powder\Nisn't easily combustible...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.10,0:51:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they replaced the ash with flour powder or\Nsomething so it would intentionally burst forth like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.58,0:51:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,When you consider the threatening letter...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.82,0:51:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,...the possibility that a criminal was\Ntargeting Sakuraba-san would be high...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.30,0:51:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, have you made an educated guess\Nas to who the criminal is?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.60,0:51:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say anything about that yet,\Nbut when I consider candidates for the criminal...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.91,0:51:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as this movie has Momoka,\Nwe'll still be cooking along on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.63,0:51:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.41,0:52:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.\NDon't worry. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.23,0:52:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot Producer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.35,0:52:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, where's Momoka?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.80,0:52:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tanaka.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.47,0:52:12.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Momoka?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.79,0:52:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, she returned from the hospital...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.28,0:52:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,...and it seems she's shut herself into\Nher waiting room ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.65,0:52:19.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.11,0:52:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Whenever she gets in a foul mood,\Nshe shuts herself in there right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.81,0:52:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tanaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.80,0:52:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.08,0:52:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Go check on how she's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.91,0:52:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.15,0:52:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoka-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.93,0:52:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.48,0:52:48.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoka-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.47,0:52:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.14,0:52:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But, the most suspicious person is...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.60,0:52:58.05,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be Momoka-chan, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.10,0:53:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoka-chan was quarreling with\NSakuraba-san before the explosion...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.61,0:53:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...and after that was talking about\Nturning down the part.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.81,0:53:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, that decides it!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.27,0:53:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The criminal...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.20,0:53:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...is Momoka!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.21,0:53:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.99,0:54:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Please open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.36,0:54:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoka-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.89,0:54:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi! What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.75,0:54:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah... I'm Inukai of\Nthe Kyoto Prefectural police.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.55,0:54:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... The actress isn't coming out\Nof her waiting room.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.09,0:54:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- This is her waiting room?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.99,0:54:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohh... Well, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.62,0:54:23.43,Default,,0,0,0,,There's really someone in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.48,0:54:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Inside that room there's\Nthis bolt mechanism...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.20,0:54:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...so that means there definitely\Nhas to be someone inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.89,0:54:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the only entrance...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.80,0:54:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That could be a big problem\Nif she got sick, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.92,0:54:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi! Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.54,0:54:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no choice but to break in...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.48,0:54:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay! Let's all of us ram it! Yeah, on one!\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.30,0:54:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,3, 2, 1... Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.34,0:54:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.29,0:55:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Ran, don't look!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.27,0:55:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... There's no doubt but that it's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.97,0:55:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The incident...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.45,0:55:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,...took place in a closed room\Nbolted from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.64,0:55:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,And if there was some other person in there,\Nit wouldn't be possible for them to get out...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.39,0:55:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Suicide...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.55,0:55:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But, why would Momoka...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.57,0:55:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The origin was the explosion\Nthat occurred during your rehearsal.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.94,0:55:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Explosion...?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.28,0:55:54.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That explosion and Momoka's suicide...\NHow are they connected?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.59,0:55:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- The thing is...\N- That explosion was not an accident...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.74,0:56:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a case of attempted murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.28,0:56:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Attempted murder?!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.19,0:56:04.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.72,0:56:05.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.05,0:56:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a purposefully planned\Nwind explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.72,0:56:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,"Dust" explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.08,0:56:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Director...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.56,0:56:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Those prop swords you used\Nduring that scuffle...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.09,0:56:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,They were prepared so they\Nwould give off sparks, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.04,0:56:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.19,0:56:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to give the appearance of power,\Nproductions often use those.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.09,0:56:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.66,0:56:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The criminal knew about the device in\Nthose swords that causes sparks to appear...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.24,0:56:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,...as well as that ash would be\Nflying around during the fight...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.57,0:56:41.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...so they switched the ash in the hearth with\Nstarch or something that tends to burn easily...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.47,0:56:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,...and intentionally caused that explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.93,0:56:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Say, that was your deduction, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.05,0:56:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Moreover, he slipped in\Na mistake here and there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.10,0:56:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And the person who was aiming to take\NSakuraba-san's life in that explosion...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.22,0:57:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...was Momoka-san, who then committed suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.94,0:57:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuraba-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.26,0:57:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It was said that you and Momoka-san\Nwere quarreling, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.75,0:57:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.78,0:57:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,To cause an explosion over a quarrel...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.55,0:57:15.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And you were being threatened, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.50,0:57:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,How would you know that...?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.53,0:57:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, well...\NI heard from one of your fellow actors...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.92,0:57:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,From inside of Momoka-san's bag...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.57,0:57:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...it seems the magazine used for\Nthe threatening letter was found.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.28,0:57:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Look, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.36,0:57:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, you were having an affair, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.27,0:57:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's had a grudge against you\Nthis entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.36,0:57:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's defamation of character!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.10,0:57:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mistake but this was the motive\Nfor Momoka-san causing that explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.13,0:57:52.63,Default,,0,0,0,,From among her belongings...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.80,0:57:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...this was also found.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.10,0:57:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It still needs to be checked...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.18,0:58:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,...but most likely it's the same powder\Nthat was used in the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.30,0:58:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.14,0:58:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The explosion was Momoka-chan, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.26,0:58:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, Momoka-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.59,0:58:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...was targeting Sakuraba-san in the explosion...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.08,0:58:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...and, getting scared afterwards,\Ncommitted suicide...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.62,0:58:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Kudo-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.81,0:58:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.58,0:58:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, but I feel the rope she was hanging\Nfrom was much too close to the entrance...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.89,0:58:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was just by chance, wasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.93,0:58:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My thought is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.49,0:58:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...it wasn't suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.80,0:58:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.37,0:58:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.27,0:58:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- In that case...\N- Momoka-san was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.36,0:58:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And the criminal...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.86,0:58:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...is most likely inside here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.52,0:58:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,That room was bolted from the inside\Nand there were no secret rooms, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.22,0:58:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If she was murdered,\Nhow did the criminal escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.99,0:59:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't some manga or novel...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.35,0:59:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be solving that trick after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.89,0:59:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there isn't any trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.58,0:59:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,When you think about the situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.68,0:59:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- ...it was suicide!\N- It was murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.21,0:59:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Suicide.\N- Murder!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.24,0:59:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Suicide! Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.54,0:59:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know about you being a high school detective\Nor whatever, but anyhow, you're an amateur.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.94,0:59:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry back home and sleep...\NHurry! Leave! Leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.07,0:59:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.\NI'll go home and sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.02,0:59:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Huh?\N- Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.93,0:59:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.73,0:59:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi you idiot.\NWhere have you gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.92,0:59:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about the people looking for you...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.60,0:59:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thank you very much.\N- Not at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.27,0:59:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.85,0:59:50.61,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, "what was that about"?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.68,0:59:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you and Fumiko-san talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.36,0:59:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What were we talking about...\NBookmarks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.50,0:59:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You're buying me one?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.46,1:00:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?! Ah, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.98,1:00:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, I'll take this one!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.56,1:00:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when did you start\Nselling these sakura bookmarks?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.17,1:00:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.36,1:00:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,These sakura-colored bookmarks are only being sold\Nfor a limited time of 2 weeks up through tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.44,1:00:19.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like with a normal bookmark,\Nit's also possible to affix your names on them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.43,1:00:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehh...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.50,1:00:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Those are nice, too...\NWhy the sakura-colored ones?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.03,1:00:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Some reason...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.79,1:00:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.30,1:00:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi!\NWhat happened so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.17,1:00:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what the trick was!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.66,1:00:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? Wai, wait... Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.63,1:00:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi! Hey!\NWhat about the bookmark!? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.24,1:01:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"Popular Idol Hayashibara Momoka\Nand Hot Actor Inside a Car Making Love!"
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.42,1:01:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think the shoot will go on for now, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.63,1:01:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,With that injury to your face,\Nyou can't have the leading role.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.45,1:01:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel sorry for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.63,1:01:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... Just think how lucky you were\Nnot to have died in that explosion.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.96,1:01:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an awful turn of events, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.36,1:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course it is!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.64,1:01:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your fault that Momoka's dead, after all.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.18,1:02:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Like I thought, that's how it was done...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.44,1:02:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.58,1:02:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What sort of trick was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.66,1:02:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The criminal first brought in a rope they had\Nsecretly made with a hoop in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.70,1:02:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.84,1:02:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.27,1:02:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Stopping in the middle like that\Ngives me the creeps!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.11,1:03:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.45,1:03:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.74,1:03:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean raising your hand\Nagainst your own parent!?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.37,1:03:28.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You were refusing\Nto have visitors, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.55,1:03:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your trademark mustache had gotten burnt,\Nso you wouldn't go out in public!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.19,1:03:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that why you were crying,\N"No visitors!"?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.75,1:03:35.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It was!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.98,1:03:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.28,1:03:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a film studio, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.55,1:03:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You were looking for a mustache?!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.65,1:03:48.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking an extra, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.16,1:03:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be thinking that that's\Nbetter than being injured.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.68,1:03:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, your hair was burned though.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.36,1:03:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.05,1:03:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They say an actor's face is their life...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.07,1:04:01.01,Default,,0,0,0,,And for me, my mustache\Nis more important than my life!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.80,1:04:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,An actor's face is their life...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.57,1:04:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Face?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.67,1:04:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.54,1:04:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Dad's fault this will be\Nso much trouble to clean up.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.28,1:04:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah. No, no... Don't touch those.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.27,1:04:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,They're scattered around so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.14,1:04:20.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, not those... Not those either!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.77,1:04:23.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that one's fine though.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.12,1:04:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one from before.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.72,1:04:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? From before? Here, here...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.33,1:04:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.91,1:04:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Here and here...\NThis might be good, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.71,1:04:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's it, huh...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.63,1:04:38.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.49,1:04:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I understand everything now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.21,1:04:45.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Because there's just one truth!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.05,1:05:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Heiji...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.83,1:05:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Heiji!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.51,1:05:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No way, right? Heiji!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.28,1:05:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.42,1:05:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...I was asked by that high school student\Ndetective to gather all of you together.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.37,1:05:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoka's suicide resolved the case, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.08,1:05:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, about that...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.69,1:05:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoka-san didn't commit suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.50,1:05:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, are you still obstinately saying that?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.23,1:05:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This was a closed room.\NA murder would be impossible, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.79,1:05:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now elucidate the trick behind that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.56,1:05:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, the murderer secretly brought in\Na rope with a hoop they had made in it...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.34,1:05:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Telling her that they wanted to discuss\Nsomething with her, they entered the room...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.51,1:05:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,...and killed Momoka-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.04,1:05:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And then they tied the rope to a beam\Nand lifted up her corpse.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.08,1:05:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,The length of the rope at this time is a highlight of\Nthe trick needed to turn this into a closed room.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.76,1:05:59.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The length of the rope?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.06,1:06:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a pendulum.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.30,1:06:08.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Though the criminal was outside of this room,\Nby using Momoka-san's body like a pendulum...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.39,1:06:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,...they could put up the bolt from inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.49,1:06:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,First off, the criminal removed the middle clasp from\Nthe tabi (split-toe socks) Momoka-san was wearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.74,1:06:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,And then they lightly fixed the bolt\Nto each side of her feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.90,1:06:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They then raised the corpse in that condition\Nand out through the open door.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.50,1:06:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,When they released their hold,\Nthe corpse reacted by swinging inside.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.47,1:06:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking that opportunity\Nto close the double doors...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.47,1:06:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,...the heels of the corpse would return and\Nstrike the door exactly due to the pendulum action.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.07,1:06:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That was how they accomplished a closed room.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.75,1:06:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of marks on\Nboth door and the bolt.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.74,1:06:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely the criminal\Nexperimented many times over...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.89,1:06:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,...in order to arrange for this trick.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.34,1:06:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, who is the murderer?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.32,1:07:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,When I considered that, there were two people who\Nbore a grudge against Sakuraba-san and Momoka-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.05,1:07:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The one with the highest possibility is...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.21,1:07:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When I considered that, there were two people who\Nbore a grudge against Sakuraba-san and Momoka-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.01,1:07:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The one with the highest possibility is...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.91,1:07:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You, Fumiko-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.33,1:07:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.03,1:07:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Fumiko-san?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.39,1:07:22.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What was her motive?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.93,1:07:24.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Jealousy.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.76,1:07:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fumiko-san envied the relationship between\NSakuraba-san and Momoka-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.49,1:07:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why... would I be jealous of those two...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.45,1:07:36.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Sakuraba-san's ex-lover, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.72,1:07:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When I came across you two yesterday, I thought\Nthat it wasn't just an ordinary relationship.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.42,1:07:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,To make sure, I confirmed that you were in\Nthe same theatrical company together.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.87,1:07:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,But Sakuraba-kun and I had already broken up.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.19,1:07:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We didn't have any lingering affections,\Nso I couldn't be jealous.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.99,1:07:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.55,1:07:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,...are you carrying around\Nthat treasured bookmark?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.68,1:08:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,That's... a matchmaking promotional item's\Ngood luck bookmark, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.15,1:08:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The bookmark you received from Sakuraba-san\Ndoes have both of your names on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.13,1:08:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,When I picked it up yesterday,\NI confirmed that without a doubt.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.14,1:08:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,"Reiichi - Fumiko"
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.85,1:08:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- That was...\N- I received this...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.81,1:08:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...from Sakuraba-kun during the time\Nwe were going together...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.29,1:08:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I just happened to be\Nholding on to it by chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.09,1:08:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be impossible, now wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.67,1:08:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.13,1:08:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,These sakura-colored bookmarks\Nare limited-time goods...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.59,1:08:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...and were put up for sale just 2 weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.25,1:08:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You were keeping this bookmark...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.14,1:08:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...because it's important to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.36,1:08:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the evidence...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.35,1:08:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,...that you still harbor feelings\Nfor Sakuraba-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.53,1:08:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fumiko...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.11,1:08:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you really attack me...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.15,1:09:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,...and murder Momoka?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.01,1:09:07.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuraba-kun, do you think of me that way?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.11,1:09:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.96,1:09:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Fumiko-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.37,1:09:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Since it'd be difficult for you to discuss it here,\NI'll hear your full story at the station...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.86,1:09:25.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.03,1:09:29.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It's certainly true\NI wanted both of their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.48,1:09:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.41,1:09:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I hated that Sakuraba was\Ngoing with that woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.22,1:09:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I and Sakuraba...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.28,1:09:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,...had belonged to the same\Ntheatrical company for over 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.80,1:09:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.64,1:09:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,...we dreamed of becoming stars together\Nthat entire time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.06,1:09:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt it natural that\NI would fall in love with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.82,1:09:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But he...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.88,1:10:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,...took up with that woman.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.35,1:10:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I was betrayed\Nand only he had his dream granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.77,1:10:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Having a fling with\Na famous Idol as a publicity stunt...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.75,1:10:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,When that explosion occurred...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.60,1:10:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I saw Sakuraba getting\Nhis face burned...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.29,1:10:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...I felt honestly refreshed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.11,1:10:19.69,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, I guess...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.79,1:10:21.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Momoka-san being killed as well...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.95,1:10:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.43,1:10:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But if even the police think so, isn't it so?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.57,1:10:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Fumiko...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.44,1:10:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Sakuraba-kun.\NThis time around, it really is farewell.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.90,1:10:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You have no acting ability,\Nyour face has been injured...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.58,1:10:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...and I think you'll have\Nhardships from here on...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.68,1:10:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But please do the absolute best you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.13,1:11:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, in the end it wasn't\Nmy deduction at all, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.70,1:11:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Kudo-kun.\NThere is always just one truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.97,1:11:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What'll happen to Fumiko from here on?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.40,1:11:31.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she's voluntarily reporting\Nas a major witness to the end...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.22,1:11:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...well, a full-fledged investigation\Nwill start now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.30,1:11:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,"Full-fledged investigation"?\NShe confessed, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.75,1:11:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Umm, but no physical evidence\Nhas been found yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.29,1:11:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If Fumiko-san left something behind at\Nthe crime scene denoting her as the criminal...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.12,1:11:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,...then she will be confirmed as the criminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.85,1:11:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi, it's about time for\Nour bullet train.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.15,1:11:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.03,1:11:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.88,1:11:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Though I call myself a detective, I'm still\Na high school student. I have to go to school.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.03,1:12:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was responsible for the deduction.\NThe rest is police work.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.74,1:12:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So long.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.86,1:12:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.81,1:12:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there! Here!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.62,1:12:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Kazuha-chan!\NAren't you overdoing it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.49,1:12:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my long-cherished ambition\Nto stab a criminal!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.38,1:12:48.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.33,1:12:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.59,1:12:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.00,1:12:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.22,1:13:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,In order to get evidence...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.80,1:13:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,...I was secretly using this camera\Nwithout telling you!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.25,1:13:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.62,1:13:10.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Be at ease.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.85,1:13:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I struck you with the back of the sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.20,1:13:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.29,1:13:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hattori!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.66,1:13:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it about time you accepted it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.05,1:13:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to end this play.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.28,1:14:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The true criminal is you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.01,1:14:04.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.25,1:14:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sakuraba Reiichi-san.\N- Sakuraba Reiichi-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.47,1:14:19.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.71,1:14:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you leave?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.11,1:14:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If I was around...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:25.72,1:14:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,...I figured you'd be on your guard about\Nfalsifying evidence, so I put on that act.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.78,1:14:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This is where movies are filmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.01,1:14:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we're called detectives,\Nwe can put on little acts.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.16,1:14:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Doyle?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.14,1:14:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.49,1:14:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Making Fumiko the suspicious one...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.08,1:14:47.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course that was an act.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.58,1:14:50.84,Default,,0,0,0,,There was no evidence to prove\Nyou were the criminal...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.93,1:14:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,...so I had to lead you to this point.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.21,1:14:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuraba-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.22,1:14:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,...you were trying to\Nplace the blame on Fumiko-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.00,1:15:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...by leaving one of her belongings\Nat the scene of the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.13,1:15:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.02,1:15:08.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I was secretly shadowing you...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.74,1:15:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,...with this camera in order\Nto get ahold of evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.51,1:15:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet even so...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.78,1:15:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, with this it's clear that\NSakuraba-san is the true criminal...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.08,1:15:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,...but why did he cause this incident?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.03,1:15:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,For money.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.87,1:15:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuraba-san contrived\Nthe dust explosion plot...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:26.83,1:15:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,...in order to get burns he could then use\Nto collect a huge insurance payout.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.79,1:15:33.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those rumors about him\Ninsuring his face were true, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.81,1:15:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,When the police checked with\Nthe insurance company to verify it...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.81,1:15:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,...they said he was expected to get an\Ninsurance payoff of 300 million yen. ($3.7 million)
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.06,1:15:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,However, you shouldn't have suffered\Nany burns in that explosion.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.33,1:15:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The evidence for that is...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.24,1:15:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This was in the costume room.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.72,1:15:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a shooting prop. Titled "International Law,"\Nit's a book of international laws from the Edo period.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.95,1:16:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a book Ryoma was always\Ncarrying with him, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.15,1:16:05.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Between the pages of this book prop...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.00,1:16:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,...there was this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.86,1:16:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,There was this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.69,1:16:13.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a fireproof material\Nused in fire doors.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.44,1:16:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely Sakuraba-san put\Nthis book inside his costume...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.04,1:16:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,...where it would protect him against\Nthe heat and shock of the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.19,1:16:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if Sakuraba-san, in his role as Ryoma,\Nwas found with this book...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.05,1:16:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,...he could say he was creating his role using it\Nand wouldn't be thought unnatural, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.59,1:16:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. And, after the explosion, he got some\Ncharcoal or something from the brazier...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.17,1:16:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,...and used it to make a burn as\Ninconspicuous as possible to his own face.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.01,1:16:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that!?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.74,1:16:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, you!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.95,1:16:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Show us your face!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.84,1:16:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Such an injury...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.83,1:16:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That could be easily hidden\Nwith make-up, couldn't it?!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.46,1:16:52.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a small injury is an injury.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.73,1:16:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,By insisting that\Nan actor's face is their lives...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.15,1:16:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,...he was just trying to swindle his way\Nto an insurance payout.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.81,1:17:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,All of your deductions\Ndepend upon your perspective.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.04,1:17:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, Sakuraba-san was behind\NMomoka-san's death?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.90,1:17:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuraba-san's popularity rose\Nthanks to Momoka-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.95,1:17:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But she almost immediately\Nturned disagreeable, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.09,1:17:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That Idol was both selfish and deeply jealous.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.02,1:17:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And so you killed her\Nand feigned it as a suicide.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.86,1:17:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Putting the magazine used to make\Nthe threatening letter...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.91,1:17:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...and the bag of powder used for\Nthe explosion in Momoka-san's bag...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.72,1:17:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...you intended to place the blame for\Nthe explosion on her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.33,1:17:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The bookmark gift you had given Fumiko-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.52,1:17:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...was also a tool you used to attract attention\Nthat you had broken up with her.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.36,1:17:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.99,1:17:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,...starting a new office with\Nthe insurance money...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:47.62,1:17:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...you thought you could make yourself\Na star on your own, right! Right!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.16,1:17:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Trifling with the hearts of two women!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.47,1:17:57.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I will definitely never forgive you for that!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.55,1:17:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's wrong about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:00.44,1:18:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with using women\Nwho I didn't even like?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.55,1:18:05.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Not once did ever...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.56,1:18:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...love either Momoka or Fumiko!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.18,1:18:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- You bastard! Shape up!\N- Sakuraba-san!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.75,1:18:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.46,1:18:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...ever consider Fumiko-san's feelings at\Nthe time when she confessed to the crime?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.62,1:18:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,When you think of...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.23,1:18:25.49,Default,,0,0,0,,...the explanations she could have come up with for\Nthe deduction I'd made, she should have had plenty.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.17,1:18:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,For example, how would it be possible\Nfor a frail woman like her...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.50,1:18:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,...to use her strength and raise a corpse\Nso it would be seen as a suicide...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.73,1:18:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,...right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.45,1:18:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.13,1:18:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would Fumiko...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.89,1:18:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't you understand that?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.89,1:18:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Fumiko-san is still in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:48.70,1:18:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Being self-centered and severely twisted,\Nthat wouldn't concern you, would it?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.35,1:18:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.36,1:18:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...was aware of your crime.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.88,1:19:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But she was never going to say that.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.32,1:19:05.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though you had broken up...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.80,1:19:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,...she's been dreaming of becoming a star\Nalong with you all this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.45,1:19:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How commendable!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.88,1:19:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of the man she loved,\Nshe lied and made herself the criminal...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.43,1:19:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You just couldn't understand the feelings of\Na woman like that, could you!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.54,1:19:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fumiko-san...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.78,1:19:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...for Sakuraba-san's sake...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.66,1:19:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,...she performed a lie as an actress.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.95,1:19:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But, in her final words...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.76,1:19:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,...I think she was...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.64,1:19:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,...entrusting her true feelings towards you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.72,1:19:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,"Then, Sakuraba-kun.\NThis time around, it really is farewell."
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.81,1:20:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,"You have no acting ability,\Nyour face has been injured..."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.17,1:20:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"...and I think you'll have\Nhardships from here on..."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.23,1:20:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"But please do the absolute best you can."
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.09,1:20:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Fumiko...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.90,1:20:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.40,1:20:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,For bringing you these painful emotions.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.77,1:20:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakuraba-kun...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.09,1:20:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Fumiko...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.72,1:20:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You...!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.14,1:20:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,For putting on that performance...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.19,1:21:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.36,1:21:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.52,1:21:08.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You set a trap for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.54,1:21:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I believed in you...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.17,1:21:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the true you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.80,1:21:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.09,1:21:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,...a beast!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.23,1:22:14.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I truly am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.67,1:22:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,For the sake of exposing the criminal...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.50,1:22:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,...I even asked you to perform\Nthe role of a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.45,1:22:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I believed in him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.51,1:22:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That he couldn't be a murderer.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.31,1:22:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,But I wasn't sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.66,1:22:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,After you had solved\Nthe trick of the closed room...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.05,1:22:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It was in his attitude.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.93,1:22:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"Fumiko..."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.39,1:22:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,"Did you really attack me..."
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.37,1:22:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,"...and murder Momoka?"
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.16,1:22:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we couldn't get there together...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.91,1:22:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...at least I wanted to\Nwatch over him from a distance.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:00.32,1:23:02.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that even now.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.01,1:23:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would you go that far for him?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.98,1:23:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.63,1:23:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,...we were fellows in with the aim of\Nbecoming actors together.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.57,1:23:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's a beautiful woman\Nsuch as yourself...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.10,1:23:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...you can have so many more\Nwonderful encounters from here on.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.01,1:23:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This Mori Kogoro guarantees that.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.73,1:23:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Starting today...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.96,1:23:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,...please start walking towards a new tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.84,1:23:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And, how about me for starters?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.00,1:23:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, Dad!\N- Sir!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.94,1:23:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh? No...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.83,1:23:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Just joking. Joking!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.50,1:23:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, Detective, I can again\Nwalk towards a new life for myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.13,1:23:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.85,1:23:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For finding the one and only truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.01,1:24:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,"Filming Canceled"
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.29,1:24:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, thanks to Doyle-kun's "Escape!" you\Ngot away from that explosion safely, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.78,1:24:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.\NIf it hadn't been for his voice...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.25,1:24:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,...I wouldn't have been able to protect\NRan's father and jump out the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.29,1:24:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But not going to see off the one who\Nsaved your life is really messed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.62,1:24:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.11,1:24:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, Doyle and I'll have\Na long fellowship, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.32,1:24:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That Kudo guy...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.00,1:24:42.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Still pretending to be Doyle\Nthis time around, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.20,1:24:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I'll be the one going to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.93,1:24:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's really okay now too, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.86,1:24:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,"I guess I'm best suited as being\Na detective and not an actor"...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.41,1:25:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,...he said, then hurried back home.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.26,1:25:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,When Fumiko-san said, "Detective"...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.54,1:25:05.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...it wasn't about Dad, was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:05.07,1:25:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I really wonder what sort of\Nthought circuits he has.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.82,1:25:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Well, we should be heading back home, too.\N- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.76,1:25:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end, he didn't buy me one.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:21.69,1:25:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Well still, it couldn't be helped.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.75,1:25:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.27,1:25:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I was out taking a walk this morning.\NI just happened down that road by chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.93,1:25:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry and get back.\NWe'll miss that bullet train.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.97,1:25:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Shin'ichi!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.15,1:25:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.61,1:26:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.16,1:26:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"This Drama is Fictional"
